---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="section cv" aria-labelledby="promise-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">Delivery &amp; warranty</span><h2 id="promise-h">Delivered, set up and looked after</h2></div>
    <ul class="promise" role="list">
      <li data-reveal style="--i:0"><Icon name="truck" /><h3>White-glove delivery</h3><p>Our own two-person team brings your furniture by box truck, carries it to the room you choose and sets it up: beds assembled, hutch tops placed. We call ahead to schedule the day and time.</p></li>
      <li data-reveal style="--i:1"><Icon name="pin" /><h3>We ship anywhere</h3><p>In-home delivery is usually about 10 days after your piece reaches our warehouse. Farther away? We ship Amish-made furniture across the country and around the world.</p></li>
      <li data-reveal style="--i:2"><Icon name="shield" /><h3>10 years of service</h3><p>We service your furniture at no charge within ten years of delivery, whether it’s construction, finish, fabric or a part. And we honor every manufacturer warranty.</p></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:var(--sp-6)"><a class="link" href="/pages/shipping-delivery">Shipping &amp; delivery details</a> · <a class="link" href="/pages/our-policies">Warranty &amp; store policies</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
